Package: taos-branding
Version: 0.2.0
Architecture: all
Maintainer: jaylfc <jaylfc25@gmail.com>
Priority: optional
Section: misc
Depends: base-files
Description: taOS identity for a Debian base
 Makes the system identify as taOS: os-release NAME and PRETTY_NAME, the
 console login banner (/etc/issue, /etc/issue.net), the motd and the GRUB
 menu entry. ID stays "debian" so Debian tooling and third-party installers
 keep working; VARIANT_ID=taos marks the derivative. Debian's own files are
 diverted, regenerated from on every base-files update, and restored on
 removal.
